  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, whenever the advisor uses the teach skill use, he can spend 1 use of skill leverage to impart his own personal anecdotes and broader advice, allowing each creature that was taught this way to use the advisor’s skill modifier for one such skill check–the creature can choose when to use the advisor’s skill modifier, but it must be done within 24 hours of being taught.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/advisor#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
